>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CALCULADORA.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VALOR-1          PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-VALOR-2          PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-SOMA             PIC 9(6)V99 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-MEDIA            PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "Digite o primeiro valor: " WITH NO ADVANCING
    ACCEPT WS-VALOR-1
    DISPLAY "Digite o segundo valor: " WITH NO ADVANCING
    ACCEPT WS-VALOR-2

    COMPUTE WS-SOMA = WS-VALOR-1 + WS-VALOR-2
    COMPUTE WS-MEDIA = WS-SOMA / 2

    DISPLAY "Soma:  " WS-SOMA
    DISPLAY "Media: " WS-MEDIA
    GOBACK.
